# Local visual evidence (regenerable): actuals, diffs, reports. Approved
# frame.json + PNGs are committed and hashed (see docs/APPROVAL-BASELINE.md):
# the C06 gate fails closed when an approved PNG is missing, so fresh
# checkouts need them. Approved fidelity sidecars stay ignored — the gate
# never reads them (they are regenerable renderer output; see src/snapshot.rs
# check_with / candidate_problem, which only read actual sidecars).
tests/visual/actual/
tests/visual/diff/
tests/visual/report.html
tests/visual/approved/*.png.fidelity.json
vendor/termlens/Cargo.lock
tests/visual/report-media/
__pycache__/
